WEBVTT

NOTE Paragraph timing uses generated clips; intra-paragraph timing is approximate.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.630
This walkthrough covers dotfiles in the Conficius TUI.

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:07.370
The dotfiles repository collects configurations for Bash, Git, Neovim,

00:00:07.370 --> 00:00:11.100
Starship, and tmux in one place, grouped by tool.

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:15.541
The Conficius configuration defines each link, with a source in the

00:00:15.541 --> 00:00:19.560
repository and a destination under the home or config directory.

00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:23.286
The dotfiles overview shows actionable, blocked, and

00:00:23.286 --> 00:00:26.240
healthy links, along with environment checks.

00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:32.885
The links view lists the configured files. Open a

00:00:32.885 --> 00:00:36.130
row to see its source, destination, and link status.

00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:43.290
Filter to actionable links and mark the

00:00:43.290 --> 00:00:45.700
file to include in the next operation.

00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:51.445
The preview shows the link that would be created.

00:00:51.445 --> 00:00:54.770
Cancel returns to the list without changing any files.

00:00:57.320 --> 00:01:01.505
This Git configuration is blocked because a file already exists at

00:01:01.505 --> 00:01:05.310
the destination. The link action will not replace that file.

00:01:07.280 --> 00:01:10.224
Healthy links already point to the correct files

00:01:10.224 --> 00:01:12.800
in the repository. No action is needed.

00:01:12.960 --> 00:01:17.703
Environment checks also flag configuration paths that do not match the selected

00:01:17.703 --> 00:01:22.050
layout. Open a warning to see the current and expected paths.
